rw-contract v1
id: N04
name: f32-reassociation
label: negative; IEEE 754 binary32 round-to-nearest-even, no FMA; checker-only (omega V0 has no FP op)
semantics: checker.f32
domain: f32
widths: 32
overflow: IEEE 754 (inf)
rounding: round to nearest even after every operation
shape: scalar
aliasing: none
effects: none (no FP exception flags modelled)
params: a b
ops: -
assume: -
lhs: (add (add x a) b)
rhs: (add x (add a b))
derive:
  (add x (add a b)) by add-assoc
end
